WEBVTT

00:08:29.396 --> 00:08:31.796
There's plenty for us to do.

00:08:31.836 --> 00:08:33.716
There's still plenty for us to explore.

00:08:34.996 --> 00:08:37.196
So this is not the end.

00:08:37.196 --> 00:08:39.236
It's not even the beginning to the end.

00:08:39.236 --> 00:08:42.756
But perhaps this may be
the end to the beginning.

00:08:43.676 --> 00:08:47.036
We may have a massive weight crisis
on the planet today,

00:08:47.076 --> 00:08:50.076
but the good news is
we are on the right path.

00:08:51.516 --> 00:08:54.436
We now have solutions
for people living with obesity,

00:08:54.436 --> 00:08:57.916
and the next steps will be
to understand even better

00:08:57.956 --> 00:09:01.036
the problems people
living with obesity are facing.